    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Nanaa Mihgo} as a Thief to begin this quest, and she will give you a {@k} {k:Letter from the Tenshodo}.
** You must have the {q:Tenshodo Membership|Tenshodo Membership|Tenshodo Membership} to continue with this quest.
* Head to {z:Lower Jeuno} and talk to {n:Harnek} inside of the {p:Tenshodo} at (J-7) for a cutscene.
* You will be given the {@k} {k:Tenshodo envelope}.
* Travel to {z:Selbina} and talk to {n:Elfriede} (J-9) of the Shepherd's Muster Inn. You will receive a cutscene with Sneaking Tiger who will ask for a {i:Quadav Stew|Quadav Stew|4569}.
* {i:Quadav Stew|Quadav Stew|4569} can only be {p:stolen|Steal} from certain Quadavs in {z:Beadeaux}.
** The stew can be stolen BEFORE you go to {z:Selbina} to save yourself some time.
* Head to {z:Beadeaux} and {p:Steal} from {m:Garnet Quadav}, {p:Silver Quadav}, {m:Zircon Quadav}, and/or {m:Bronze Quadav} until you obtain the {i:Quadav Stew|Quadav Stew|4569}.
* Once you get the {i:Quadav Stew|Quadav Stew|4569}, go back to {z:Selbina} and trade the stew to {n:Elfriede} (J-9).
* You will receive the {@k} {k:Signed envelope}.
* Head back to {z:Lower Jeuno} and talk to {n:Harnek} (J-7) for a final cutscene and to receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* Having {M:Windurst Mission 2-1|Windurst Mission 2-1|Lost for Words} active will prevent you from starting this quest.
* {p:Nanaa Mihgo} is involved in several quests and missions, so you may have to talk to her multiple times to trigger the cutscene that begins this quest.

